msgid ""
"**Description**: Analyze Spearman correlation between two genes across "
"TCGA cancer samples using cBioPortal data. Returns correlation "
"coefficient and p-value. Useful for identifying co-expressed genes in "
"tumor microenvironment. Note: TIMER2.0/3.0 REST API is no longer public; "
"uses cBioPortal as data source. Example: Correlate CD8A and PDCD1 "
"expression in BRCA."
