#: ../../tools/timer_tools.rst:73 b4569a108ce046e7869ef3f1eb3b8d4a
msgid "**Name**: ``TIMER2_immune_estimation``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/timer_tools.rst:75 5286a80bffc041aa9286d5414e0298ef
msgid ""
"**Description**: Estimate immune cell abundance in TCGA cancer samples "
"using TIMER-equivalent marker gene expression from cBioPortal. Returns "
"infiltration proxies for 6 immune cell types (B cells, CD4+ T cells, CD8+"
" T cells, neutrophils, macrophages, dendritic cells) using canonical "
"marker genes (CD19, CD4, CD8A, FCGR3B, CD68, ITGAX). Note: TIMER2.0/3.0 "
"REST API is no longer public; this tool uses cBioPortal TCGA data as a "
"proxy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/timer_tools.rst:82 860ffe108dc0430abb77a186d1c7b770
msgid ""
"``cancer`` (string) (required) TCGA cancer type abbreviation (e.g., "
"'BRCA', 'LUAD', 'COAD', 'SKCM', 'GBM')"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/timer_tools.rst:85 f50880c594294f2b87157c2d2dc12c8c
msgid ""
"``gene`` (string, null) (optional) Optional gene symbol to correlate with"
" immune infiltration (e.g., 'CD8A', 'PDCD1')"
msgstr ""

